 To add John Doe and Maria Garcia as participants to the 'Introductory meeting' event on May 15, 2024, you can use the `add_calendar_event_participants` function:

```json
{
  "name": "add_calendar_event_participants",
  "arguments": {
    "event_id": "Introductory meeting",
    "participants": ["john.doe@clientcorp.com", "maria.garcia@bluesparrowtech.com"]
  }
}
```
